  "functional_changes": [
    "Every supplied current combat field, player record, target preview, pile, deck and native rule is checked against the original native input.",
    "Identity aliases are round-trip checked. A required fact digest survives packing, text interning, presentation and final compiler validation; missing or modified facts stop the request.",
