    "Missing Block previews no longer parse only the first sentence of a conditional rule.",
    "Unrecognized powers, relics, card attachments, automatic actors and uncomputed actions invalidate dependent counterfactual totals while retaining native values/rules.",
    "Unordered follow-up kill budgets were removed; all active power/relic rules remain in the effect ledger, including zero-stack effects."
